                                    '\n⠀⠀score-gradient transparency\n⠀- Bias Meter: score-based hue with\n⠀⠀fixed transparency\n⠀- Confirmed Bias: bias hue with fixed\n⠀⠀transparency' +
                                    '\n⠀- Bias Meter Char: fixed meter BG +\n⠀⠀L/M/H/E chars in upper chart third\n⠀- Bias Meter Aligned: fixed meter BG +' +
                                    '\n⠀⠀confirmed A/X chars in upper chart third\n⠀⠀(not a raw above/below VWAP check; no\n⠀⠀A/X inside the internal deadband; A/X\n⠀⠀requires persistence on confirmed bars)\n⠀- Squeeze & Trend: Gold=Squeeze, Blue=Trend\n⠀- RVOL State: activity intensity BG\n⠀(gray/orange/red)\n⠀- VWP Stretch: VWAP stretch BG\n⠀(gray/orange/red)\n⠀- ADR% Heat: orange heat from ADR%\n⠀(transparency 90%→20%)\n⠀- Volatility% Heat: orange heat from\n⠀Volatility% (transparency 90%→20%)\n')

string M_FORM = "○"
string M_CONF = "●"
color MARKER_COLOR = color.new(color.white, 50)
marker_size_grid = size.normal
panel_value_size_grid = size.small
marker_size_inline = size.small
panel_header_size = size.small
